1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          Lemon, Floral, Blue berry\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：瑰夏 Gesha\n          <span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n           Iridescence\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：二氧化碳浸渍水洗 CM Washed\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味：橙花、柚子、水果硬糖\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          Orange blossom, Yuzu, Fruit candy\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：瑰夏 Gesha Don Eduardo\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：二氧化碳浸渍日晒 CM Natural\n         </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味：橘子、杏桃、樱桃、红色莓果、淡淡的茉莉绿茶感\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          Tangerine, Apricot, Cherry, Red berries,\n          <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n           Jasmine tea-like\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于Savage Coffees\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          萨维奇咖啡，是由黛博拉、艾瑞斯庄园的拥有者Jamison Savage主导的一个咖啡项目，它的出现是为了推广性价比更高的巴拿马优质咖啡，利用在黛博拉庄园的处理经验与系统，用于周边Volcan和Boquete区域的友邻们的咖啡种植成果，而生产处理更优品质与更高商业价值的咖啡，使得参与的友邻们都可以从中得到一份更好的收益，市场上也有更多元化的产品流通。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SyCEHetF0SicyI41Sib0QTehbybYcxE7pl8icHufDpWgEJWKlyiaN14l5KBMn98KyWvA88SaJF6YUnuQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;height: auto !important;vertical-align: bottom;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;'/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2021年，我们第一次接触到Halo批次的瑰夏，今年我们有3个批次，分别是卡杜拉，卡杜艾与瑰夏。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          卡杜拉这支它的发酵感非常轻，相比我们喝过的卡杜拉它的甜感和果汁感尤为突出。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          目前还没有查到这支卡杜拉来自哪个庄园，Savage官网有的2020年的竞拍记录里的卡杜拉是来自于Santa Maria庄园，在Savage的Instagram上面找到一小段视屏，Savage先生提到2022产季的卡杜拉采用的是传统的日晒处理方式，他们的生长海拔介于1600 - 1900米之间。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Don Eduardo Estate 是第四代 Boquetenian Harold Sabin 拥有和经营的农场，2016年创立，Savage提供了12000棵瑰夏树苗将Don Eduardo纳入了Savage Coffees计划，目前Savage拥有Don Eduardo的瑰夏和卡杜艾的独家经营权。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Taste of Varietal\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我们有5只来自Savage的豆子，3只都采用了都采用了相似的处理方式；卡杜拉柑橘调性突出，卡杜艾会带一些莓果调，\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           瑰夏Spectrum批次就很花香、蓝莓干；\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           另外一只瑰夏Halo批次做了一定时间的厌氧发酵，所以它会喝起来有厌氧带来的热带水果和轻微可可的调性，值得一提的是Halo虽然是上一产季的豆子，但喝起来风味还是很饱满突出；\n           <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Iridescence批次是水洗处理方式，能更凸显瑰夏这个品种在Savage所管理的地块上种植、处理出来的风味清晰度和整体果感、甜感的饱满和层次。\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          <br style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px 0px 0em;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;vertical-align: bottom;height: auto !important;display: initial;visibility: visible !important;width: 431px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
